This package has mixed record-level licenses. No single license applies to the entire repository.

For active records, follow each record's publication_rights and the matching entry in sources.json. See LICENSES.md, LICENSE_STATUS.md, and ATTRIBUTION.md for a summary.

The exact v1.2.0 historical archive is retained under history/v1.2.0/. Its files keep their historical notices. The 506 CAICT legacy rows in that archive are excluded from active v2 because source-level adaptation and redistribution permission was not established.
